# twin: render_one
# vulkan/negotiate_v2 with a core that draws only when its create_device2
# was given a surface its queue can present to: the instance its
# create_instance makes through the harness's wrapper must have the
# surface extensions for the headless surface the harness makes on it.
console 0 core=test render=vulkan
option 0 link_test_render vulkan
option 0 link_test_vk_negotiate v2
option 0 link_test_vk_surface needed
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
